<title>USA: Millicom Q3 shr profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Millicom Q3 shr profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.57     loss	 $0.16</p>
<p> Net profit		27,850     loss	 7,873</p>
<p> Revs			55,414		   33,964</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  48,950		   48,584</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.17     loss	 $0.38</p>
<p> Net profit		 8,017     loss	18,008</p>
<p> Revs		     146,965		   89,487</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  48,855		   47,416</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q3 1996 includes a $55.8 million gain related primarily to the exchange of Millicom's option in Comviq GSM AB, a Swedish cellular operator, for shares in NetCom Systems AB, a Norwegian cellular operator.</p>
<p>Full company name is Millicom International Cellular SA</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
